        "command": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "命令名称。\n- INSERT_PLAY_SCRIPT: 插入表演脚本。用于互动回复。数字人不变,背景不变。params结构定义:[PlayTextInfo](metastudio_02_0014.xml)\n- INSERT_PLAY_AUDIO:插入驱动音频。用于音频直接驱动。数字人不变,背景不变。params结构定义:[PlayAudioInfo](metastudio_02_0014.xml)\n- REWRITE_INTERACTION_RULES: 修改互动规则。params结构定义:[PlayAudioInfo](metastudio_02_0014.xml)",
